  'Storage devices': {summary:'Storage devices keep data and information so that it can be used later.',points:['A hard disk stores data inside a computer.','A pen drive is a portable storage device.','Memory cards can store photos, videos, and other files.','CDs and DVDs are optical storage media.'],activity:'Show a pen drive or memory card and ask students what kinds of files can be stored on it.',illustrations:[['💽','Hard disk','Stores computer data.'],['🔑','Pen drive','Portable storage.'],['💳','Memory card','Stores photos and files.'],['💿','CD/DVD','Optical storage media.']]},
